<title>ITALY: Mondadori H1 96 pretax profit falls.</title>
<headline>Mondadori H1 96 pretax profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons pretax profit		    35.6  vs    52.3</p>
<p>    Cons turnover			1,091    vs 1,031.9</p>
<p>    Gross operating margin		87.6  (down 7.1 bln)</p>
<p>    Parent pretax profit		  19.6  vs    51.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Publisher Mondadori is controlled by former prime minister Silvio Berlusconi's Fininvest group.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
